AmiBinkD v10.25 - SpitfireTN Ent.
-=====================================-
Native AmigaOS FTN mailer, binkd port.
No ixemul/ixnet -- talks straight to
bsdsocket.library. BinkP protocol,
CRAM-MD5 auth, FTN mail for C-Net/5
and other BBS engines. Fixes shredded
log lines and outbound 0-byte mail.
-=====================================-
